    </p>
    <p>
      Exchange rate used in this article: <strong>1 AUD ≈ 0.60 €</strong> (April 2026). Current reference rates at the <a href="https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/eurofxref-graph-aud.en.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">European Central Bank</a>. EUR amounts are rough conversions, not fixed prices.
    </p>
  </div>

